/S /P
/E (Glaucoma is a leading cause of blindness, and its early detection depends on accurate measurement of intraocular pressure \(IOP\). Existing methods are invasive, uncomfortable, and limited to clinical environments, making routine monitoring difficult and inaccessible to many.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [2]
>>
