444 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (It is  a portable, non-invasive device that uses air puff technology to measure IOP. It provides a comfortable, patient-friendly method for early glaucoma detection and regular monitoring outside clinical settings.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
445 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The portable device measures intraocular pressure \(IOP\) using a gentle air puff to deform the cornea, with pressure sensors analyzing the deformation. IoT integration enables remote monitoring, and interference pattern analysis ensures accuracy. It offers convenient self-monitoring at home for early detection of eye problems. We generate revenue by selling the device to hospitals, eyecare clinics and we also provide on the basis of  subscription)
/Alt ()
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
